        "Description": "Deep in the suburbs a kill order is issued, our client has tracked a local serial killer and narrowed it down to three suspects, take them all out to be safe. \r\rLissy drives her ice cream truck around town, giving her a great alibi, though she always seems to be close to murders \r\rRachel is a local soccermom, always driving her kids around close to killings, quite suspicous \r\rThaddeus is married to Rachel and might be an accomplace\r\rStephen has been seen with the victims before their deaths",
